  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.5.0: Promoted Silk (OpenCL) backend and BERT-family model layer (BertModel, ModernBertModel, LayaHeadModel, tokenizers, loaders, GPU seam) into Nivara.Extensions (namespace Nivara.Silk / Nivara.AI); added NivaraEmbeddingExtensions for the float[] / E0..En frame convention and Microsoft.Extensions.AI conversion; real opt-in zero-copy Arrow export; mask-based nullable column storage handling; Streamix backpressure and pivot advances. Existing surface: Parquet read/write with compression, Apache Arrow bidirectional conversion, ML.NET DataView integration, CsvHelper-based CSV parsing, lazy data source infrastructure, immutable options with With() builders. Full changelog in CHANGELOG.md.",
